<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2000/1/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue of a sum not exceeding eighteen billion four hundred and twenty-nine million four hundred and forty-eight thousand and nine hundred ringgit (RM18,429,448,900) out of the Consolidated Fund for the service of the year 2000 is hereby authorised."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2000/1/eng@> .
